@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Backhand length check
@track Out of 10
Backhand length check, two minutes. Straight drives to length from behind the short line: a racket
head above the service line, first bounce behind the service box. In the last thirty seconds, the
ladder check: score ten by how many bounce first behind the short line. Reset with a softer one
whenever you need to. Resets don't count. Phase two target: eight out of ten, misses in between
allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
17% Racket up early. Finish high.
50% Aim higher, not harder.
-0:30 Ladder check. Score the next ten. Target: eight out of ten.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
